LeetCode 1752 – Check if Array Is Sorted and Rotated:

class Solution:
    def check(self, nums: List[int]) -> bool:
        n=len(nums)
        ct=0
        for i in range(n-1):
            if nums[i]>nums[i+1]:
                ct+=1
        if nums[-1]>nums[0]:
            ct+=1
        return ct<=1


💡 Logic to Remember:
A sorted array has 0 drops.
A sorted & rotated array has exactly 1 drop.

A drop is when:

nums[i] > nums[i + 1]

Since the array is circular, also check:

nums[-1] > nums[0]
If drops ≤ 1, return True; otherwise False.
🧠 Memory Trick

"Count the drops in the circle."

0 drops → Sorted ✅
1 drop → Sorted & Rotated ✅
2+ drops → Invalid ❌


